  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "what it says. Basically, locally, your visemes are always going off as if your microphone was picking something up. This is locally on the avatar, and is reflected in mirrors and your camera. Interestingly, muting yourself does stop it. (In that it freezes at whatever speaking viseme it is currently on) But it is not feedback or background noise, as the microphone icon is not lighting up.\nThis is still in as of the beta VRChat 2020.4.1p5, build 1010 as well, fyi",
